OL,3,GNEWSAGuinness 'heist' CCTV footage of
OL,4,Atwo men released
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives investigating the "brazen
OL,7,Fheist" of more than 70,000 pints of
OL,8,FGuinness have released footage of two
OL,9,Fmen they want to speak to.
OL,11,FAbout 880 barrels of the beer,
OL,12,Festimated to be worth #115,000, were
OL,13,Ftaken when two HGV trailers were stolen
OL,14,Ffrom a depot in Runcorn, Cheshire, on
OL,15,F31 August.
OL,17,FPolice have released footage of the two
OL,18,Florries which were involved in the
OL,19,Ftheft arriving at the site, the first
OL,20,Fat about 19:45 BST and the second
OL,21,Fshortly after 21:00.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
